[SECTION]
TITLE: 5. Coverage Analysis

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
Structural coverage analysis is performed using VectorCAST with MC/DC analysis plugin. For Level A software, the following coverage objectives must be achieved:

- **Statement Coverage:** 100% of executable statements must be exercised
- **Decision Coverage:** 100% of decision outcomes (true/false) must be exercised
- **MC/DC Coverage:** 100% of conditions must be shown to independently affect decision outcomes

Coverage analysis results are documented in the Software Verification Results (SVR) document.
<<<

[/SECTION]

[SECTION]
TITLE: 6. Traceability Matrix

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
All test cases trace to software requirements. The complete traceability matrix is maintained in DOORS and shows:

- Software requirements to test cases (verification coverage)
- Test cases to software requirements (requirement satisfaction)
- Test cases to low-level requirements (design verification)

**Summary:**
- High-Level Requirements: 15 requirements, 8 test cases
- Low-Level Requirements: 25 requirements, 15 test cases
- Verification Coverage: 100%
<<<

